WEBVTT

00:16.070 --> 00:18.240
<b>9S really went through hell.</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:23.500
<b>We sent him to the Bunker body and all,
so he should be repaired in no time.</b>

00:24.040 --> 00:25.080
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:25.460 --> 00:28.500
<b>I only delivered him
to YoRHa Squad's retrieval point.</b>

00:28.630 --> 00:30.130
<b>It's not worth getting thanked over.</b>

00:30.840 --> 00:32.130
<b>But still...</b>

00:32.460 --> 00:33.590
<b>Be careful.</b>

00:34.880 --> 00:36.840
<b>You are alone right now.</b>

00:39.850 --> 00:42.350
<b>Pod. Patch me through
to the Commander.</b>

00:43.770 --> 00:48.860
<b>Good job on the destruction of the special
machine lifeform, code named Eve.</b>

00:49.230 --> 00:50.690
<b>Upon further analysis,</b>

00:50.690 --> 00:56.570
<b>we learned that the majority of their
network system was being managed by Eve.</b>

00:56.910 --> 01:02.410
<b>Destruction of their network hub should
weaken the machine lifeforms significantly.</b>

01:02.870 --> 01:07.790
<b>According to the remaining special unit Adam,
the aliens have been wiped out.</b>

01:08.080 --> 01:11.130
<b>About that... We will confirm it.</b>

01:11.460 --> 01:13.340
<b><i>Until then, don't tell anyone.</i></b>

01:13.340 --> 01:16.180
<b>Understood. And...</b>

01:16.300 --> 01:16.880
<b><i>What is it?</i></b>

01:17.760 --> 01:19.350
<b>What about 9S?</b>

01:19.510 --> 01:22.930
<b><i>9S will undergo
a full data overhaul up here.</i></b>

01:23.140 --> 01:26.770
<b><i>Assuming there aren't any issues, we're planning
to partner him with you again.</i></b>

01:26.770 --> 01:30.520
<b><i>I will also authorize 9S's pod
to accompany you in the meanwhile.</i></b>

01:31.440 --> 01:32.530
<b>Understood.</b>

01:32.730 --> 01:37.150
<b><i>While 9S is out of commission,
I have another mission for you.</i></b>

01:38.410 --> 01:42.370
<b><i>With the destruction
of their key unit Eve,</i></b>

01:42.370 --> 01:45.870
<b><i>numerous machine lifeforms have been
severed from their network.</i></b>

01:46.120 --> 01:51.250
<b><i>But we have also confirmed that
a new network is in the process of being built.</i></b>

01:51.670 --> 01:55.380
<b><i>We have deduced the location where
their communications are concentrated.</i></b>

01:55.630 --> 02:00.220
<b><i>It is highly likely that the other key unit,
Adam, is located there.</i></b>

02:00.720 --> 02:04.430
<b><i>I want you to head to the target location
and destroy Adam.</i></b>

03:37.780 --> 03:39.150
<b>Eve.</b>

03:40.950 --> 03:44.160
