<b>I'm glad you understand so quickly.</b>

20:26.240 --> 20:27.540
<b>Let's see.</b>

20:27.870 --> 20:33.040
<b>The special unit I saw was a mid-sized
four-legged machine lifeform.</b>

20:33.040 --> 20:35.710
<b>It was in a herd of deer in the forest.</b>

20:35.710 --> 20:38.590
<b>It was acting as if it was a deer itself.</b>

20:39.090 --> 20:42.050
<b>Of course, after I recorded the data,
I destroyed it.</b>

20:42.050 --> 20:44.930
<b>I see, that's quite an interesting unit.</b>

20:44.930 --> 20:48.430
<b>Popola, what kind of information
do you have about special units?</b>

20:48.430 --> 20:51.810
<b>There are two special units that I've seen,
and one of them</b>

20:51.810 --> 20:56.230
<b>was different
from normal machine lifeforms.</b>

20:56.230 --> 20:59.020
<b>It was trying to mimic an ancient lifeform,</b>

20:59.020 --> 21:03.280
<b>looking like a large reverse-joined unit,
and firing laser beams from its mouth.</b>

21:03.280 --> 21:07.990
<b>Such an ominous unit.
I see, that is quite intriguing.</b>

21:08.160 --> 21:10.410
<b>What kind of unit was the other one?</b>

21:10.410 --> 21:14.540
<b>The other one greatly differed
from other machine lifeforms as well.</b>

21:14.960 --> 21:20.800
<b>It attacked me in the desert area.
It looked like a tank but had hideous decorations.</b>

21:20.800 --> 21:24.510
<b>It was a unit that I really felt
the tenacity towards killing androids.</b>

21:24.760 --> 21:26.720
<b>I'm surprised that you survived.</b>

21:26.930 --> 21:29.430
<b>In any case,
why did a maintenance android</b>

21:29.430 --> 21:33.140
<b>have to head out
into the dangerous desert area?</b>

21:33.350 --> 21:36.650
<b>I was going to pick a desert rose.</b>

21:36.650 --> 21:38.810
<b>A desert rose?</b>

21:39.110 --> 21:41.150
<b>Is that material for something?</b>

21:41.150 --> 21:44.400
<b>Or was another
dangerous job shoved at you?</b>

21:44.400 --> 21:49.660
<b>There wasn't. We went to go pick it
on our own accord. Actually, we use it to...</b>

21:49.660 --> 21:53.120
<b>Hey, the booze we made
from the desert rose is ready!</b>

21:53.120 --> 21:56.000
<b>Leave all the difficult talk aside
and let's have a drink!</b>

21:56.000 --> 21:57.080
<b>You are...</b>

21:57.080 --> 22:03.210
<b>I'm the Resistance's maintenance unit,
the redhead twin android, Devola.</b>

22:03.210 --> 22:06.340
<b>9S, was it? You can drink, of course?</b>

22:06.340 --> 22:08.640
<b>I don't drink alcohol while on duty.</b>

22:09.140 --> 22:10.260
<b>Cheers!</b>

22:10.890 --> 22:15.180
<b>Phew! This totally sinks
into my nonexistent internal organs!</b>

22:15.180 --> 22:17.940
<b>That reminds me, someone
was saying the other day</b>

22:17.940 --> 22:21.150
<b>that some folks add "mew"
to the ends of sentences when drunk.</b>

22:21.150 --> 22:23.070
<b>Ain't that funny?</b>

22:23.070 --> 22:27.070
<b>That is so cute, and may be very popular.</b>

22:27.570 --> 22:29.410
<b>Hey, are you drinking up, 9S?</b>

22:29.410 --> 22:33.290
<b>Man, he's already asleep.
What a hopeless case, mew!</b>

22:36.830 --> 22:37.790
<b>Shlink!</b>

22:38.120 --> 22:40.080
<b>We'll somehow manage here!</b>

22:40.080 --> 22:41.960
<b>9S, please call for backup!</b>

22:42.290 --> 22:43.840
<b>Wait, he's asleep!</b>

22:44.050 --> 22:45.800
<b>Wake up, 9S!</b>

22:47.590 --> 22:55.520
<b>2B, you finally called me "Nines."
I'm so happy!</b>

22:55.520 --> 22:56.520
<b>Wake up!</b>

22:56.520 --> 22:57.390
<b>Please get up!</b>

22:59.020 --> 23:00.440
<b>I had fallen asleep.</b>

23:00.650 --> 23:02.270
<b>This situation!</b>

23:02.610 --> 23:07.320
<b>What I can do right now
is to cheer them on!</b>

23:07.440 --> 23:10.780
<b>Oh, go for it, and do your best, Devola!</b>

23:10.780 --> 23:14.160
<b>Go for it, and do your best, Popola!</b>

23:14.160 --> 23:18.210
<b>Defeat the machine lifeforms!</b>

23:18.210 --> 23:24.590
<b>- Here, and there, and here, and there!
- 9S. Please! We can't last like this!</b>

23:24.590 --> 23:27.920
<b>- Here, and there, and here, and there!
- 9S! We're done for!</b>

23:28.300 --> 23:30.590
<b>Maybe this isn't the time
to be cheering right now!</b>

23:30.590 --> 23:33.140
<b>Everything is way too late now!</b>

23:34.390 --> 23:37.140
<b>For some reason, 9S started cheering
for Devola and Popola who were mid-combat.
The three of them were crushed to death, of course.</b>

23:37.850 --> 23:39.890
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
